  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that multimodal models with scvi_n200 RNA encoder and imagenet_vit_l image encoder (config_039) achieve the highest validation accuracy (0.725). This experiment tests whether switching the RNA encoder to scgpt (a more complex model) while keeping the image encoder and aggregation method the same (transformer) could improve performance. This isolates the effect of the RNA encoder choice, which remains uncertain despite scvi_n200's strong performance in rna_only settings. It balances exploitation of the current best setup with exploration of a key design decision."
}

